## TIẾNG ANH · 16:30–17:00

> *"On the free tier the API sleeps after idle time. Cold start can take half a minute. I mitigate with an external cron ping, but I don't pretend that removes the problem. The client shows a connecting state and retries with longer delays instead of screaming network error on the first request of the day."*

**5 từ:** `cold start` · `idle` · `mitigate` · `scream` *(metaphor)* · `warmup`

